Say here where each file in this folder comes from: which files are your own, and for anything
derived from someone else's work (a grammar, its queries, an editor's syntax file) the
repository, the revision, the files, and the licence. Then paste each licence's full text below.

Example:

  grammar.wasm is built from https://github.com/<owner>/tree-sitter-<language> at revision
  <commit> (MIT). queries/highlights.scm is adapted from that repository's
  queries/highlights.scm. language.json and Example.sublime-syntax are our own.

  <the full MIT licence text of tree-sitter-<language>, with its copyright line>
